{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/4/1a41a74f4b87c2030272c5f28734c84104c4867e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt {x + 10} - \\frac {6}{\\sqrt {x + 10}} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"191\" height=\"42\" /> has: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/8/4187aeb2c71a4fedaeec246af6e6cc3cc2222ac6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{an extraneous root between } - 5\\text{ and } - 1 \\\\  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{an extraneous root between }-10\\text{ and }-6\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{a true root between }20\\text{ and }25\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{two true roots}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{two extraneous roots}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"428\" height=\"77\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/2/9726474bd63c6398062ad158d1f06957a3d8cba4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = \\sqrt{x+10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"102\" height=\"21\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/7/f4728fba596614687eefd0ca63f4de01cf0d5f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u - \\frac{6}{u} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/7502ce786177a25169cacb88195235f95df19eea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u^2 - 5u - 6 = (u-6)(u+1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"262\" height=\"21\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/5/775a6e82925369e4865ec114a273ef1a22f997d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x+10} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"21\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea4d23a1a984becc7ca61a1efac00d730fff5df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x + 10} = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"115\" height=\"21\" />.  \n</p><p>The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/5/775a6e82925369e4865ec114a273ef1a22f997d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x+10} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"21\" /> has a real solution of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9db00326b618c1b3c7a165f704cec548646806a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 26$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c5b9f4381dcd6700fb212b7de26020e0fd6e4c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x+10} = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"115\" height=\"21\" /> has an extraneous solution of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc64acecd9d1fa7e3e0f5f4df71d2b362a70ad38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -9$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />.  Therefore, the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f837331cda0b69f57e7bb53dd9dfded708aa6b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{an extraneous root between }-10\\text{ and }-6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"361\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/8/c28f72dd886476c6d87da941f99299c7ebcb59b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x+10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/1/3e16e95b6a7c2036d01d070b8bcbdd9a2ea9e0d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+4=5\\sqrt{x+10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" />. We can now square both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94b39753dbdd17d141011ca4f8652ea8c38cdb89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+8x+16=25x+250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"201\" height=\"16\" />, which yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba2d525a4fef4a40f44cc1d91544b9f361f79d63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-17x-234=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"151\" height=\"15\" />. We can factor the quadratic as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/6/f561ac435caa4be1cca6610584dc8375714fac0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+9)(x-26)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" />, giving us roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a483ee25b066703890405f0127fef9c31572fb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda00d9a38a0c6bd9aac2512c6d065581882d43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging in these values, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a483ee25b066703890405f0127fef9c31572fb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> is an extraneous root and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda00d9a38a0c6bd9aac2512c6d065581882d43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is a true root. This gives us the final answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f837331cda0b69f57e7bb53dd9dfded708aa6b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{an extraneous root between }-10\\text{ and }-6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"361\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems